{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026Kzi1E1ANcp1794564018.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>港珠澳大橋半馬拉松周日早上舉行。</p><p></p><p>賽事今屆升級為世界田徑聯會認可的白金級道路賽事，為全球第4個獲最高級別認證的半馬賽事，預計有近10,000名選手參與，其中3成為非本地跑手。除了半馬挑戰組及公開組，亦首設10公里挑戰組。因應賽事，警方周六下午起，分時段在港珠澳大橋實施封路，視乎賽事進度，預計至周日下午才完全解封。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.MARATHON-1630.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026Gyg33IQSZd1794564031.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>警方新界南總區交通部執行及管制組署理總督察張浩煒說：「警方在此呼籲，各位駕駛者及旅客，本周六、日，如果大家要使用港珠澳大橋，請留意臨時交通安排，留意橋面及隧道的限速更改，往返香港、珠海、澳門的旅客，請預留額外的行車時間。」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T10:39:52.961546+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":269,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T08:09:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T11:57:51.288974+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T10:33:16.985128+00:00","content_hash":"2a67cc0b506a3ac492e2a5b7477ce6b597aac95db6b2972bde94e2d03ca4ead9","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-13T10:39:52.961546+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}